1
00:00:00,066 --> 00:00:01,436
One hundred two point two.

2
00:00:03,236 --> 00:00:06,106
(Sheldon:)Exactly what it was half an hour ago.

3
00:00:06,406 --> 00:00:08,736
(Sheldon:)It's like you're not even trying to get better.

4
00:00:11,411 --> 00:00:14,211
(Amy:)Sheldon, you don't get over the flu
in half an hour.

5
00:00:14,414 --> 00:00:15,904
(Sheldon:)Well, not with that attitude.

6
00:00:17,417 --> 00:00:21,477
You know, I have to say,
I'm finding your bedside manner a little lacking.

7
00:00:21,721 --> 00:00:24,921
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry. I just want you to get better
as soon as possible.

8
00:00:25,492 --> 00:00:29,152
(Sheldon:)And with that goal in mind,
let me ask you a question.

9
00:00:29,362 --> 00:00:31,792
(Sheldon:)Do you believe in the placebo effect?

10
00:00:31,998 --> 00:00:35,228
(Amy:)Of course I do. There have been many studies
proving its validity.

11
00:00:35,435 --> 00:00:40,375
(Sheldon:)Great. Now, this may look like a Tic Tac...

12
00:00:41,741 --> 00:00:46,041
(Sheldon:)...but it is really a powerful medication
specifically designed...

13
00:00:46,279 --> 00:00:49,769
(Sheldon:)...to cure your illness,
as well as freshen your breath.

14
00:00:50,617 --> 00:00:53,027
(Amy:)Sheldon, this isn't helping.

